_my":"စည်းကမ်းအတိုင်း အကာအကွယ်ပစ္စည်းတွေကို စနစ်တကျ ဝတ်ဆင်ပါ။","audio_file":"10.03.04-S004.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"10.03.04-S005","kind":"main","cn":"这里很滑。","meaning_my":"ဒီနေရာ အရမ်းချော်တယ်။","audio_file":"10.03.04-S005.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"10.03.04-S006","kind":"main","cn":"小心，很烫！","meaning_my":"သတိထား၊ အရမ်းပူတယ်။","audio_file":"10.03.04-S006.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"10.03.04-S007","kind":"main","cn":"这里禁止进入。","meaning_my":"ဒီနေရာကို ဝင်ခွင့်မရှိဘူး။","audio_file":"10.03.04-S007.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"10.03.04-S008","kind":"main","cn":"先别碰，可能有电。","meaning_my":"အခု မထိနဲ့ဦး၊ လျှပ်စစ်ရှိနိုင်တယ်။","audio_file":"10.03.04-S008.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"10.03.04-S009","kind":"main","cn":"我手受伤了。","meaning_my":"ကျွန်တော်/ကျွန်မ လက် ထိခိုက်သွားတယ်။","audio_file":"10.03.04-S009.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"10.03.04-S009_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"先到安全的地方，我帮你叫人。","meaning_my":"လုံခြုံတဲ့နေရာကို အရင်သွားပါ၊ လူခေါ်ပေးမယ်။","audio_file":"10.03.04-S009_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"10.03.04-S009_alt01","kind":"alternative","cn":"我的手受伤了。","meaning_my":"ကျွန်တော်/ကျွန်မ လက် ဒဏ်ရာရသွားတယ်။","audio_file":"10.03.04-S009_alt01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"10.03.04-S010","kind":"main","cn":"我手流血了。","meaning_my":"ကျွန်တော်/ကျွန်မ လက် သွေးထွက်နေတယ်။","audio_file":"10.03.04-S010.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"10.03.04-S011","kind":"main","cn":"有人摔倒了！","meaning_my":"လူတစ်ယောက် လဲကျသွားပြီ။","audio_file":"10.03.04-S011.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"10.03.04-S012","kind":"main","cn":"有人受伤了，快叫救护车！","meaning_my":"လူတစ်ယောက် ဒဏ်ရာရသွားပြီ၊ လူနာတင်ကား အမြန်ခေါ်ပါ။","audio_file":"10.03.04-S012.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"10.03.04-S012_reply01","kind":"reply","cn":"我马上打急救电话。","meaning_my":"အရေးပေါ်ဖုန်းကို ချက်ချင်းဆက်မယ်။","audio_file":"10.03.04-S012_reply01.mp3","audio_status":"not_recorded"},{"id":"10.03.04